WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.970
Websites, apps and AI agents that work because they are tested.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.880
An untested AI gets things wrong with total confidence:

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.390
it makes up dates and presents them as fact.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.240
This is the Radar Croacia WhatsApp agent.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:24.080
It answers in four languages, only from official sources.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.080
And when needed, it hands you over to a person,

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.510
who replies from the support panel.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.140
The same goes for your practice or shop:

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.580
appointments and reminders on WhatsApp,

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:45.160
and a dashboard you can ask about your sales.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.900
Before we deliver, we test everything:

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.280
hundreds of automated tests and trick questions for the AI.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.210
And an agent checks every change.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.400
WhatsApp agents, dashboards that answer,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.900
new websites and a review of the AI you already use.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:13.950
Tell us what you need to get working.

